    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n87988" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προμᾰχ-ίζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>fight before,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρωσί</span>
			<i>in front of</i> the Trojans, as their champion, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				3.16
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. τινός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nonn.
					<u>D.</u>
					27.265
				</span></i>
			, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>fight as champion with</i> another, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀχιλλῆϊ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					20.376
				</span></i>
			.</div>
